steps:
Step 2 — TrainingLab.tsx visual polish. The current layout is a flat stack of inputs with no visual grouping. Apply these CSS-only improvements:
  a) Add className='training-stats' to the <p>Your examples: N commands · N speech clips</p> paragraph and define: .training-stats { display:flex; gap:20px; padding:12px 16px; border-radius:10px; background:var(--purple-50); font-size:12px; color:var(--purple-700); }
  b) Wrap the task type selector row (studio-row containing select + Input for group) in a div className='training-toolbar' and define: .training-toolbar { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; padding:14px 16px; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; background:var(--muted); }
  c) Add className='training-audit-item' to each .studio-audit div in the Reviewed examples section and define: .training-audit-item { padding:14px 16px; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; background:var(--card); transition:background .15s ease-out; } .training-audit-item:hover { background:var(--purple-50); } .training-audit-item strong { font-size:12px; color:var(--purple-700); }. Replace className='studio-audit' with className='studio-audit training-audit-item' on each row in TrainingLab.tsx. The existing .studio-audit rule in crm-studio.css can remain.

Step 5 — Global hover and focus state consistency across index.css. Audit and upgrade the following existing patterns:
  a) .surface-card: add box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm); transition:box-shadow .18s ease-out; and .surface-card:hover { box-shadow:var(--shadow-md); } — but only for surface-cards inside .content-stack that are not already buttons.
  b) .metric-card: add transition:transform .18s ease-out, box-shadow .18s ease-out; .metric-card:hover { transform:translateY(-1px); box-shadow:var(--shadow-md); }
  c) .contact-card: already has transition:background — add box-shadow:var(--shadow-xs) to base and box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm) on hover.
  d) .activity-row: add transition:background .14s ease-out; and .activity-row:hover { background:var(--purple-50); border-radius:8px; }
  e) .full-task-row: add transition:background .14s ease-out; and .full-task-row:hover { background:var(--purple-50); }
  f) .primary-button: update box-shadow to use the shadow token: box-shadow:var(--shadow-md); and .primary-button:hover { box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg); }
  g) All focus-visible rules: update to use outline:2px solid var(--ring); outline-offset:3px; for consistency — update the global button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible rule to use var(--ring).
